# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Panasonic V-Log L
# Cameras  : GH5, GH6, S5, S5II, S1, BGH1, AU-EVA1
# Input    : Panasonic V-Log L log / V-Gamut
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  V-Gamut → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.800 – 1.010
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.560 – 0.570
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.489 – 0.499
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.418 – 0.428
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.351 – 0.360
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.287 – 0.296
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.130
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Panasonic V-Log L"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

